{"resourceIdentifier":"3603","resourceName":"Jiangsu Lisaike PET Recycling Project","description":"Jiangsu Lisaike PET Recycling  Protect (hereafter referred to as “the Project”) aims to produce PET flakes by recycling and processing post-consumer PET bottles, to replace the same amount of PET products produced from raw materials. It is planned that 80,000 tons of post-consumer PET bottles per year will be recycled into 65,000 tons of PET flakes at maximum production capacity. The project located in  Xuyi Country, Huaian City,  Jiangsu, China and is developed and operated by Jiangsu Lisheco Environmental Protection Material Technology Co., Ltd.(hereafter referred to as “the project proponent”).\r\nPrior to the project implementation, the same amount of PET flakes was produced from raw materials (crude oil and natural gas); the baseline scenario is the same as the condition prior to project initiation. The Project achieves GHG emission reductions by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and by reducing related energy consumption as well.\r\nThe estimated annual average GHG emission reduction is 59273 tCO2e and the total estimate GHG emission reductions over the first crediting period is 414911 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":32.992197,"longitude":118.591618},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-09-23","endExclusive":"2022-10-24","endInclusive":"2022-10-23"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3603"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu Lisaike Environmental Protection Material Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3603"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59277"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.AJ."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31/07/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 16/03/2021 - 15/03/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=71761&IDKEY=88723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0898958419","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Lisaike-Joint-Project-Descriptionv1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-02T03:09:09.39Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=71762&IDKEY=5iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfo98959798","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Jiangsu_Lisaike_Listing_Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-02T03:12:43.587Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=94832&IDKEY=098klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d8130773328","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Joint PD-MR_VCS3603_v03_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-07-31T11:55:45.323Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86210&IDKEY=8kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9090118883590","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"08-Lisaike registration representation_VCS3603.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-10T10:49:27.61Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=948